                    Period, <hi rendition="#italic">post</hi>, <ref target="#pg750">page 750</ref>;
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>) Greece—Government and Elections, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">post</hi>, <ref target="#pg1041">page 1041</ref>; (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">d</hi>) Poland—Government and Elections, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">post</hi>, <ref target="#pg1104">page 1104</ref>; and
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">e</hi>) Yugoslavia—Implementation of the Yalta
                    Declaration on Yugoslavia, <hi rendition="#italic">post</hi>, <ref
                        target="#pg1207">page 1207</ref>.</p>
